<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  The Settings hub (com.fadcam.ui.settingshub). Every row opens the same screen or sheet the classic
  Settings tab opens; the classic tab stays reachable from the last row.

  Each row has a title, a one-line description, and "names": other words people use for it, comma
  separated. Names are never shown; search reads them, so "flashlight" finds Torch. Translate them
  as the words a person would type in that language, not word for word.
-->
